      "locator": {
        "page": 8,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p8_s8"
      },
      "text": "If the domain dll.freshdns.org rings a bell, it should.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_28",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Operation_EphemeralHydra",
      "locator": {
        "page": 8,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p8_s9"
      },
      "text": "While covering a different Internet Explorer Zero-day (CVE-2013-3893) and the associated Operation DeputyDog campaign, we reported that the CnC infrastructure used in that campaign overlapped with this same domain: dll.freshdns.org.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_29",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Operation_EphemeralHydra",
      "locator": {
        "page": 8,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p8_s10"
      },
      "text": "Inside the in-memory version of the Trojan.APT.9002 payload used in this strategic Web compromise, we identified the following interesting string: “rat_UnInstall”.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_30",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
